(7651737, 1245045, 156466, '<td valign="top">Dang, I know that place!! Should have gone down and gotten something with an ultrawide and the organ pipes down at the other end. That said, the colors projected on the walls are cool. I''ve been there several times with different light conditions and never seen that.</td>', 'Dang, I know that place!! Should have gone down and gotten something with an ultrawide and the organ pipes down at the other end. That said, the colors projected on the walls are cool. I''ve been there several times with different light conditions and never seen that.', '2020-01-27 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
