(7651743, 1244598, 156466, '<td valign="top">If you don''t believe me I''ll offer proof after voting but that you missed perfect symmetry here is maddening for me. And because you''re soooooo close it''s even worse. And believe me, I know it''s not easy to do, but it''s necessary.</td>', 'If you don''t believe me I''ll offer proof after voting but that you missed perfect symmetry here is maddening for me. And because you''re soooooo close it''s even worse. And believe me, I know it''s not easy to do, but it''s necessary.', '2020-01-27 17:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
