(7651860, 1244666, 251313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> Is that the moon back there in the haze? </i></td></tr></table> Yes, it is.</td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: Is that the moon back there in the haze?  Yes, it is.', '2020-01-29 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
