(7652060, 1244963, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fine photo - emotive travel and place AND architecture at its best.  Congratulations on the blue.  <br/>I enjoyed the story of your getting this one, too.  I suggest you re-copy it and paste it into the description.  Some don''t read through comments (though many do as they can be as good as or sometimes better than the image LOL ) and that way anyone who comes upon this even years from now will have that added context.<br/>Gotta love husbands who respond like this - I have one, too :)</td>', 'Fine photo - emotive travel and place AND architecture at its best.  Congratulations on the blue.  I enjoyed the story of your getting this one, too.  I suggest you re-copy it and paste it into the description.  Some don''t read through comments (though many do as they can be as good as or sometimes better than the image LOL ) and that way anyone who comes upon this even years from now will have that added context.Gotta love husbands who respond like this - I have one, too :)', '2020-01-30 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652061, 1244679, 138630, '<td valign="top">I, too, love the sense of scale ... and especially the way the church architecture picks up the shape of the mountain and surrounding terrain.  Congratulations on the TT</td>', 'I, too, love the sense of scale ... and especially the way the church architecture picks up the shape of the mountain and surrounding terrain.  Congratulations on the TT', '2020-01-30 11:54:54.000000', NULL, 0);
